Cell["\<\
From a theoretical perspective, each stepping probability produces a \
characteristic mean travel distance whose variance spreads linearly with the \
distance. Play with the parameters below: \
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.917259444186783*^9, 3.9172595171090813`*^9}, {
  3.917259759271021*^9, 3.917259824898246*^9}, {3.9172598827635202`*^9, 
